Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eternal river that\Nnever stops flowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It reminds me of cigarette smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this kid's crazy if he\Nthinks I'll toss this much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cigarette away just hold your\Nhorses for two minutes, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, relax, I'm coming!
