Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should think I am\Ngoing to be a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.08,0:01:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hand. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:02:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I want to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.58,0:02:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go back\Nto the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wasn't there an urban legend that\Nbeast folk meat was used in hamburgers?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, there was!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there were fingers\Nwith claws in it! So gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you not talk about disgusting\Nstuff while we're eating our food?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what is that? What's wrong?\NA finger? Is it a finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh, uh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sis! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.15,0:03:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell told her that it\Nwas okay to smoke in the kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.34,0:03:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.44,0:03:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, thanks for helping me\Nout with all of this, Yaniko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My porno manga and yawn\Nmagazine deadlines overlapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thought I was gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.20,0:03:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:03:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assistants these days aren't usually\Nokay with cigarettes, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I draw my art by hand, so I need\Nmy assistant in the room with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they hate it when I smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, you're\Npretty easy to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm naturally a shy person, but I feel\Ntotally comfortable sitting here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.76,0:04:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to sound rude, but I'm kind of\Nglad you got fired from your last job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you're paid\Nwell for all of this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
