Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice. Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.22,0:04:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're doing great so far, Yani Neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.22,0:04:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, so this is your\Nlittle sister, huh? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise you won't bring my\Nlittle sister into any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't, as long as you\Ndo what we agreed on.
