Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People want more readers, so they fall\Nback on whatever trope is already popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To them,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.77,0:13:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it becomes less about creating something
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meaningful and more\Nabout seeking validation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're missing the whole point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, these aren't published authors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should write whatever they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the whole point of\Ndoing it online, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I was wondering, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, a friend that I have\Nwrites stories on Kakeyome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to know if you could read\None and give me your honest opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you write stories on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, my friend does.
