Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.04,0:13:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of a dramatic fantasy story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Major is like the job title, because\Nin that world, every character...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and let me read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.64,0:14:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't really get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, neither did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friend just started writing,\Nso that's most likely why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They haven't had much practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell them to write an\Nenemies-to-lover story, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll tell them!
